I take my bicycle and ride into the city center.
The weather is beautiful today.
It is warmer than last week.
The streets are very full.
Many people are outside and enjoying the sun.
But with the bicycle I am faster than the cars.
I arrive at a large shopping street.
There are many shops and cafes here.
I am looking for new clothes for the summer.
On the right side I see a large boutique.
The shop window is very bright and interesting.
I stop and get off.
I lock my bicycle to a bicycle rack.
Then I take my backpack.
I walk through the large glass door into the shop.
It is much bigger inside than I thought.
The light is bright, and colorful shirts and jackets are hanging everywhere.
This is the perfect place for my shopping.
